<div class="shell">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <a href="/" class="brand"><span class="brand-icon">◉</span> OPENSHIFT <strong>WATCH</strong></a>
    <div class="side-label">WORKSPACE</div>
    <a href="#overview" class="nav active"><span>▦</span> Overview</a>
    <a href="#incidents-section" class="nav"><span>⚑</span> Incidents <b id="nav-incidents">0</b></a>
    <div class="side-label">WATCHED PROJECTS</div>
    <div id="project-list" class="project-list">Choose projects to start</div>
    <button id="configure" class="button sidebar-button">Manage projects</button>
    <div class="sidebar-bottom"><span class="local-dot"></span> Local monitor<div>No cluster deployment</div></div>
  </aside>
  <main id="overview">
    <header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span> Overview</div><span id="mode" class="mode">{{#if demo}}DEMO{{else}}LIVE{{/if}}</span></header>
    <div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">CLUSTER OBSERVABILITY</div><h1>Application health</h1><p>One view of your projects. A heads-up when something needs you.</p></div><div class="heading-actions"><button class="button" id="notifications">Enable notifications</button><button class="button primary" id="refresh">↻ Check now</button></div></div>
    <div class="connection-bar"><span id="connection-dot" class="connection-dot"></span><strong id="connection">Connecting…</strong><span id="context"></span><span id="last-check" class="last-check">Waiting for first check</span></div>
    <div id="messages" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    {{#if demo}}<div class="demo-bar"><strong>Demo playground</strong><span>Try an incident, then inspect logs and proposed fixes.</span><select id="scenario" aria-label="Demo scenario"><option value="healthy">All healthy</option><option value="outage">Crash loop outage</option><option value="degraded">Partial replica loss</option><option value="oom">Memory / OOMKilled</option><option value="image">Image pull failure</option><option value="pending">Pending / unschedulable</option><option value="config">Startup configuration error</option><option value="probe">Readiness probe failure</option><option value="storage">Storage claim pending</option><option value="quota">Project quota reached</option><option value="route">Route admission problem</option><option value="connection">Lost cluster access</option></select></div>{{/if}}
    <section class="stats" aria-label="Health summary">
      <button class="stat stat-filter" data-status="all"><div>Monitored apps <span>▦</span></div><strong id="total">0</strong><small id="project-count">Across 0 projects</small></button>
      <button class="stat stat-filter healthy-stat" data-status="healthy"><div>Healthy <span>●</span></div><strong id="healthy">0</strong><small>All desired replicas ready</small></button>
      <button class="stat stat-filter degraded-stat" data-status="degraded"><div>Degraded <span>●</span></div><strong id="degraded">0</strong><small>Partial capacity or pod issues</small></button>
      <button class="stat stat-filter down-stat" data-status="down"><div>Down <span>●</span></div><strong id="down">0</strong><small>No ready replicas</small></button>
    </section>
    <section class="panel apps-panel">
      <div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Applications <span id="app-count" class="count">0</span></h2><p>Inspect pods, search logs, and understand the next steps.</p></div></div>
      <div class="filter-bar"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search applications…" aria-label="Search applications"><select id="project-filter" aria-label="Filter project"><option value="all">All projects</option></select><select id="status-filter" aria-label="Filter health"><option value="all">All statuses</option><option value="healthy">Healthy</option><option value="degraded">Degraded</option><option value="down">Down</option><option value="unknown">Unknown</option><option value="scaled-zero">Scaled to zero</option><option value="completed">Completed</option></select><button id="reset-filters" class="text-button">Reset filters</button></div>
      <div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>APPLICATION</th><th>PROJECT</th><th>STATUS</th><th>READY / DESIRED</th><th>RESTARTS</th><th>DETAILS</th></tr></thead><tbody id="app-rows"></tbody></table></div>
      <div id="empty" class="empty"><span>◎</span><h3>Choose the projects you want to watch</h3><p>Use Manage projects to select your OpenShift namespaces.</p></div>
      <div class="panel-footer"><span id="observation-note">Read-only observations</span><span class="pagination"><button id="app-prev" class="text-button" aria-label="Previous application page">←</button><span id="app-page"></span><button id="app-next" class="text-button" aria-label="Next application page">→</button></span><span id="poll-note"></span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="panel" id="incidents-section"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Incident activity <span id="incident-count" class="count">0</span></h2><p>Confirmed problems, acknowledgements, and recoveries.</p></div><div class="incident-actions"><label class="sound-toggle"><input id="sound" type="checkbox"> Alert sound</label><button id="clear-incidents" class="button small">Clear board</button></div></div><div class="filter-bar incident-tabs"><button class="tab selected" data-incidents="active">Active</button><button class="tab" data-incidents="resolved">Resolved</button><button class="tab" data-incidents="all">All activity</button><span id="incident-summary"></span></div><div id="incidents" class="incidents"></div><div class="panel-footer"><span id="incident-page"></span><span class="pagination"><button id="incident-prev" class="text-button">← Previous</button><button id="incident-next" class="text-button">Next →</button></span></div></section>
    <footer class="page-footer">OpenShift Watch 1.2 <span>Local logs · Guided troubleshooting · Read-only cluster access</span></footer>
  </main>
</div>
<dialog id="project-dialog"><form id="project-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>Watch your projects</h2><button type="button" class="icon-button" id="close-dialog" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><p>Select projects you can access. You can also enter names directly if project listing is restricted.</p><button type="button" class="button" id="load-projects">Load accessible projects</button><div id="available-projects" class="available-projects"></div><label class="field-label" for="namespace-input">Project names, separated by commas</label><textarea id="namespace-input" rows="3" placeholder="my-project, another-project"></textarea><div id="project-error" class="form-error" role="alert"></div><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save & start monitoring</button></div></form></dialog>
<dialog id="detail-dialog" class="inspector"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">APPLICATION INSPECTOR</div><h2 id="detail-title">Application details</h2><p id="detail-subtitle"></p></div><button class="icon-button" id="close-details" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><div class="inspector-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Application details"><button id="tab-pods" class="tab selected" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="pane-pods" data-pane="pods">Pods & health</button><button id="tab-logs" class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pane-logs" data-pane="logs">Logs</button><button id="tab-diagnostics" class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pane-diagnostics" data-pane="diagnostics">Diagnostics</button><button id="tab-fixes" class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pane-fixes" data-pane="fixes">Issue & proposed fixes</button></div><section id="pane-pods" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-pods"><div id="detail-content"></div></section><section id="pane-diagnostics" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-diagnostics" hidden>
  <div class="diagnostic-toolbar"><label>Pod to investigate<select id="diagnostic-pod" aria-label="Diagnostic pod"></select></label><span class="read-only-pill">Read-only investigation</span><button id="diagnostic-refresh" class="button primary">Refresh evidence</button><button id="diagnostic-copy" class="button" disabled>Copy report</button></div>
  <div id="diagnostic-status" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Load events, resource settings, probes, rollout state, storage, and service backends.</div><div id="diagnostic-content"></div>
</section><section id="pane-fixes" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-fixes" hidden><div id="fixes-content"></div></section><section id="pane-logs" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-logs" hidden>
  <div class="log-controls"><label>Pod<select id="log-pod"></select></label><label>Container<select id="log-container"></select></label><label>Recent lines<select id="log-tail"><option value="500">500</option><option value="1000" selected>1,000</option><option value="5000">5,000</option><option value="10000">10,000</option></select></label><label>Time window<select id="log-since"><option value="300">Last 5 minutes</option><option value="3600" selected>Last hour</option><option value="86400">Last 24 hours</option><option value="0">Any retained time</option></select></label></div>
  <div class="log-actions"><label class="sound-toggle"><input id="log-previous" type="checkbox"> Previous container instance</label><button id="log-load" class="button primary">Load logs</button><button id="log-live" class="button">Start live</button><button id="log-stop" class="button" disabled>Stop</button></div>
  <div id="log-notice" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Select a container and load recent logs. Logs stay in this browser session.</div>
  <div class="log-search"><input id="log-search" type="search" placeholder="Search loaded logs…" aria-label="Search loaded logs"><select id="log-level" aria-label="Filter log severity"><option value="all">All levels</option><option value="error">Errors</option><option value="warn">Warnings</option><option value="info">Info / other</option><option value="debug">Debug</option></select><label class="sound-toggle"><input id="log-autoscroll" type="checkbox" checked> Follow newest</label><button id="log-download" class="button small">Export loaded lines</button></div>
  <div id="log-viewport" class="log-viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrollable container logs"><div id="log-spacer"><div id="log-rows"></div></div></div><div class="log-footer"><span id="log-count">No lines loaded</span><span>Click a line to inspect it in full · Search covers loaded lines only</span></div>
  <div id="log-line-detail" class="log-line-detail" hidden><div><strong>Selected log line</strong><button id="copy-log-line" class="button small">Copy line</button><button id="close-log-line" class="text-button">Close</button></div><pre id="log-line-text"></pre></div>
</section></dialog>
<dialog id="clear-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>Clear incident board</h2><button id="close-clear" class="icon-button" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><p>Clear resolved history, or clear the entire board. This only changes local incident records.</p><div class="notice">Ongoing problems remain visible in application health. After clearing everything, they create new incidents when the confirmation threshold is met again.</div><div id="clear-error" class="form-error" role="alert"></div><div class="dialog-actions"><button id="clear-resolved" class="button">Clear resolved only</button><button id="clear-all" class="button danger-button">Clear all incidents</button></div></dialog>
<div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
